update public.tips set body_md = '| to me | **se me** cayó | I dropped it |
| to you | **se te** cayó | you dropped it |
| to him, her | **se le** cayó | he dropped it |

Same with *rompió, perdió, pasó*: **se me pasó** — *I forgot*. The middle word says who it happened to.' where id = '0ae8a455-b5ec-5603-9920-7d5ea5055cc5' and body_md = '| to me | **se me** cayó | I dropped it |
| to you | **se te** cayó | you dropped it |
| to him, her | **se le** cayó | he dropped it |

Same with *rompió, perdió, olvidó*: **se me olvidó** — *I forgot*. The middle word says who it happened to.';
update public.tips set body_md = 'When it happened to all of you, the middle word is **nos**: **se nos acabó el café** — *we ran out of coffee*; **se nos rompió la heladera**. To a friend: **¿se te pasó?** — *did you forget?*' where id = '0b9529ef-e03d-56ae-a6c7-238a59a0dca8' and body_md = 'When it happened to all of you, the middle word is **nos**: **se nos acabó el café** — *we ran out of coffee*; **se nos rompió la heladera**. To a friend: **¿se te olvidó?**';
update public.tips set body_md = 'Spanish tells accidents as if they happened *to* you: **se me cayó** — *I dropped it* (it fell on me); **se me rompió** — *it broke on me*; **se me pasó** — *I forgot* (it slipped my mind). Nobody is to blame, which is the point.' where id = '6f7cea1b-f51c-566f-be92-462456d6f490' and body_md = 'Spanish tells accidents as if they happened *to* you: **se me cayó** — *I dropped it* (it fell on me); **se me rompió** — *it broke on me*; **se me olvidó** — *I forgot*. Nobody is to blame, which is the point.';
update public.tips set body_md = '| | one thing | more than one |
| to me | **se me** quemó la comida | **se me** cayeron las llaves |
| to you | **se te** pasó | |
| to us | **se nos** acabó el café | |

The verb follows the thing: one thing **-ó**, more than one **-aron / -eron**. The middle word says who it happened to: **se me**, **se te**, **se le**, **se nos**.' where id = 'aa612ce1-aae0-5abb-ac0a-dce44906d427' and body_md = '| | one thing | more than one |
| to me | **se me** quemó la comida | **se me** cayeron las llaves |
| to you | **se te** olvidó | |
| to us | **se nos** acabó el café | |

The verb follows the thing: one thing **-ó**, more than one **-aron / -eron**. The middle word says who it happened to: **se me**, **se te**, **se le**, **se nos**.';
update public.tips set body_md = '**Caliente** is for things: *el café está caliente*. Said about a person it means angry — or something ruder — so for yourself use *tengo calor*, and for the weather *hace calor*.' where id = '19fdd686-0f86-5a0c-a998-5e353ecd8fd9' and body_md = '**Caliente** is for things: *el café está caliente*. Said about a person it means angry — or something ruder — so for the weather or yourself, use *tengo calor*.';
update public.tips set body_md = '| Te lo presto, **con tal de que** me lo **devuelvas**. | on condition that |
| Te lo presto, **salvo que** lo **necesite**. | unless |
| Llevá el auto, **siempre y cuando** no lo **choques**. | as long as |
| Llevá plata **por si** la **necesitás**. | just in case |

Every condition takes the subjunctive, except **por si**. For *vos*: **devuelvas, rompas, cuides, manejes, choques**.' where id = 'a59cf449-d6eb-5aaa-991e-068e5d300711' and body_md = '| Te lo presto, **con tal de que** me lo **devuelvas**. | on condition that |
| Te lo presto, **salvo que** lo **necesite**. | unless |
| Llevá el auto, **siempre y cuando** no lo **choques**. | as long as |
| Llevá plata **por si** lo **necesitás**. | just in case |

Every condition takes the subjunctive, except **por si**. For *vos*: **devuelvas, rompas, cuides, manejes, choques**.';
update public.tips set body_md = '**Ando buscando laburo**, **estamos por arrancar**. **Le cae bien a todo el mundo**; **a ese no lo aguanto**.' where id = '09c42605-395e-554f-8c40-6ffd14be9063' and body_md = '**Ando buscando laburo**, **estamos por arrancar**. **Le cae bien a todos**; **a ese no lo aguanto**.';
update public.tips set body_md = '| what was said | what you tell |
| «¿Venís?» | Te preguntó **si venías**. |
| «No puedo.» | Me dijo **que no podía**. |
| «No podés.» | Te dijo **que no podías**. |
Reported, the present steps back: *venís* → **venías**, *podés* → **podías**.' where id = '36697118-aa35-5d9f-a477-33933af76e3d' and body_md = '| what was said | what you tell |
| «¿Venís?» | Me preguntó **si venías**. |
| «No puedo.» | Me dijo **que no podía**. |
| «No podés.» | Me dijo **que no podías**. |
Reported, the present steps back: *venís* → **venías**, *podés* → **podías**.';
update public.tips set body_md = 'Living in a building means paying **expensas** — *the monthly building fees* — to the **consorcio**. The **encargado** is the building caretaker, and knows everything.' where id = '91a5e921-8540-53dc-904c-1b0a1d6a8502' and body_md = 'Living in a building means paying **expensas** — *the monthly building fees* — to the **consorcio**. The **encargado** is the building''s super, and knows everything.';
update public.tips set body_md = '**Me afanaron la billetera**, **me estafaron**; **se tapó la pileta**, **se trabó el ascensor** — the *they* nobody names, and the *se* nobody did.' where id = 'cab9d500-1ea5-50a6-b22b-98ddbe3c2137' and body_md = '**Me afanaron la billetera**, **me estafaron**; **se tapó la canilla**, **se trabó el ascensor** — the *they* nobody names, and the *se* nobody did.';
update public.tips set body_md = 'Words ending in *-r*, *-n*, *-e* take **-cito**: **calor → calorcito**, **café → cafecito**. Short *sol* does too: **solcito**. Words in *-o* just swap it for **-ito**, and a *c* turns *qu*: **fresco → fresquito**. Porteños talk about the weather almost only in diminutives: **hace fresquito**, **qué lindo calorcito**.' where id = '25238004-814b-58f4-824a-ded9fff9bc9e' and body_md = 'Words ending in *-or*, *-ol*, *-e* take **-cito**: **calor → calorcito**, **sol → solcito**. Words in *-o* just swap it for **-ito**, and a *c* turns *qu*: **fresco → fresquito**. Porteños talk about the weather almost only in diminutives: **hace fresquito**, **qué lindo calorcito**.';
update public.tips set body_md = 'Porteños get married **por civil** — *at the registry office* — and, if there is a church wedding too, with a **padrino** and a **madrina**; then the **luna de miel**. When **nació una nena** or **un nene**, you visit. At a **velorio** — *a wake* — you hug and say **te acompaño en el sentimiento**.' where id = 'fcd34b7a-a72e-5992-8c6c-e82915d7622a' and body_md = 'Porteños get married **por civil** — *at the registry office* — often with a **padrino** and a **madrina**, then the **luna de miel**. When **nació una nena** or **un nene**, you visit. At a **velorio** — *a wake* — you hug and say **te acompaño en el sentimiento**.';
